			"widgets_values":[
				"### Description of the image sequence:\n\n1. **Frame 1 (Top-left):** A close-up shot of the gray phone case with a built-in circular stand shown flat against a white surface. This highlights the sleek design of the product.\n\n2. **Frame 2 (Top-right):** Hands are shown holding the phone case upright, focusing on its slim profile and button cutouts.\n\n3. **Frame 3 (Middle-left):** Hands demonstrate the circular stand being opened from the back of the phone case, showcasing its functionality.\n\n4. **Frame 4 (Middle-right):** The phone case is placed on a flat surface with the circular stand extended, displaying the phone in a horizontal stand position.\n\n5. **Frame 5 (Bottom-left):** Hands gently rotate the circular stand, emphasizing the ease of use and sturdiness.\n\n6. **Frame 6 (Bottom-right):** A side profile shot of the phone case in its stand position, highlighting stability and minimalistic design.\n\n---\n\n### Video Concept (15-second TVC Ad):\n\n#### **Opening Scene (0–3 seconds):**\n- Start with a close-up shot of the gray phone case on a pristine white surface (Frame 1). Soft lighting enhances the texture and design. Light, cheerful music begins playing in the background.\n\n#### **Second Scene (3–6 seconds):**\n- Transition to a shot of a well-manicured hand holding the phone case upright (Frame 2). The camera smoothly pans across the side, showcasing the slim profile and precise cutouts.\n\n#### **Third Scene (6–9 seconds):**\n- Cut to a close-up of the hands unfolding the circular stand from the back of the case (Frame 3). The motion is smooth and deliberate, highlighting the ease of use.\n\n#### **Fourth Scene (9–12 seconds):**\n- The phone case is placed on a table with the stand extended (Frame 4). The camera rotates around the phone, capturing it from different angles to emphasize stability and functionality.\n\n#### **Closing Scene (12–15 seconds):**\n- A side-profile shot (Frame 6) zooms out to reveal a lifestyle setup—a cozy desk with a coffee mug and notebook in the background. The phone case stands prominently, completing the visual story.\n\n#### **Music and Style:**\n- A light, upbeat tune with subtle percussion complements the visuals. The transitions between shots are seamless, with smooth pans and fades.\n\n---\n\nThis creates a polished and engaging TVC ad that aligns with the commercial style and showcases the product's design and functionality intuitively."
